---
import Page from '../layouts/Default.astro';
import Title from '../components/Title.astro';
import Text from '../components/Text.astro';
import Subtitle from '../components/Subtitle.astro';
import Content from '../components/Content.astro';
---

<Page title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for Globed - an open-source, highly customizable multiplayer mod for Geometry Dash.">
    <Content>
        <Title>Privacy Policy</Title>

        <Text>
            Last updated: 2026-06-12
        </Text>

        <div class="h-8" />

        <Subtitle>Data We Collect</Subtitle>

        <Text>
            We temporarily store server logs to keep <span class="text-qvintiary-default font-bold">Globed</span> running properly.
            These logs may include your <span class="text-accent-default">account ID</span>, <span class="text-accent-default">username</span>,
            <span class="text-accent-default">platform</span>, <span class="text-accent-default">IP address</span>,
            <span class="text-accent-default">connection type</span>, the <span class="text-accent-default">levels or rooms</span>
            you join, and other in-game behavior. All logs are used strictly for
            <span class="text-tertiary-default">debugging</span> and <span class="text-tertiary-default">statistical purposes</span>,
            and are never kept for more than 30 days.
        </Text>

        <div class="h-6" />

        <Text>
            We may also keep some anonymous data for statistics, such as which levels are played most often.
            This data cannot be used to identify you. No data is ever shared with third parties.
        </Text>

        <div class="h-8" />

        <Subtitle>Discord Integration</Subtitle>

        <Text>
            We also permanently store certain data when you link your
            <span class="text-quardiary-default font-bold">Discord</span> account, specifically your
            <span class="text-quardiary-default font-bold">Discord</span> ID and username.
            You can unlink your Discord account in-game, or by emailing
            <span class="text-accent-default">help@globed.dev</span>.
        </Text>
    </Content>
</Page>
